  "title": "· New Bags · Balenciaga Drops New Le City Silhouettes: Backpack & Bucket Bag",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 上架 Le City 系列新包型：双肩包，水桶包",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga adds a backpack and bucket bag to its Le City line, blending edgy moto details with playful, compact silhouettes.",
