      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga’s Fall 26 collection welcomes two new members to the Le City family: a backpack and a bucket bag. The new designs carry forward the iconic moto-bag signatures—distressed metal studs, braided handles, and leather cord zipper pulls—while their compact silhouettes inject a playful, adorable charm into the edgy Le City line, offering more versatility for everyday styling.",
