    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Le City Backpack features a compact, elongated trapezoid shape with a flap closure, topped with a removable top handle and equipped with adjustable, detachable shoulder straps. Crafted from finely grained lambskin, it is available in petal pink, volcanic gray, and classic black and white, plus a coffee-brown suede calfskin version that feels particularly autumnal. The mini size is lightweight and portable, freeing your hands while adding a youthful, casual vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
