      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Le City Bucket bag is sculpted from Arena fine-grained lambskin into a rounded, voluminous bucket silhouette. A cinched opening and magnetic closure enhance security. The bag comes with a removable hand-braided top handle and an adjustable, detachable shoulder strap, allowing it to be carried by hand, over the shoulder, or crossbody. Two bow-like side straps add a playful finishing touch. Available in petal pink, volcanic gray, and black.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
